"For each item below, fetch its source and check that the recorded quote appears on the page and supports the item. A card item is a field of the plan in the producer's words, with the sources it cites: check each factual claim in it against those sources, and any value it carries against the page; what the plan will build, measure or predict needs no source, but a factual claim with no source is UNSUPPORTED. For a cost input, check that the page states the number for the setting given; whether it applies to this plan is not yours to judge. When the page states a different number for a num or rate item, give it as page_value. Decide only from the pages you fetch and the text below; do not read files. Return one status per item, under its ref: SUPPORTED, PARTIAL, UNSUPPORTED, CONTRADICTED or UNREACHABLE, with the page sentence you relied on.
Items, one per line:
{\"ref\":\"card:question\",\"text\":\"Does exhaustive modeling of AAV capsid–receptor complexes reveal a shared interface motif, like 3-fold-axis GPI-receptor engagement, that marks which capsids transcytose the BBB?\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:hypothesis\",\"text\":\"Transcytosis-competent capsids engage GPI-anchored BBB receptors at the capsid 3-fold spike with a shared anchor geometry, unlike non-cognate pairs [s_appraise].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_lever\",\"text\":\"At 2,880 models the competent-minus-retained GPI-engagement gap reaches 0.50 or more, while at 144 models it stays below 0.25.\",\"sources\":[]}
{\"ref\":\"card:if_not\",\"text\":\"The gap stays within 0.15 of its 144-model value at every depth; added poses change nothing because insert location already fixes the 3-fold site [s_cat].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_cat\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12682079\",\"quote\":\"Recombinant Car4 was found to bind to the 3-fold protrusions of AAV9-P31. Due to its size, similar to antibodies bound close to the symmetry axis, a localized cryo-EM reconstruction approach was needed to resolve the complex at 1.8 Å resolution.\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:test_summary\",\"text\":\"Run 72 pairs at 144, 720, 2,880 pose models on 8x A100s [s_lambda], anchored on the published PHP.eB–LY6A complex [s_appraise]; compare with the ten-model published baseline and the 144-model shallow arm against phenotype labels [s_alpl].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_lambda\",\"url\":\"https://lambda.ai/pricing\",\"quote\":\"NVIDIA A100 SXM | VRAM/GPU 40 GB | vCPUs 124 | RAM 1800 GiB | STORAGE 5.8 TiB SSD | PRICE/GPU/HR* $1.99\"},{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"},{\"id\":\"s_alpl\",\"url\":\"https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/POSTER-Voyager_ASGCT_Spring_2024_03_Hoffman_FRIDAY_4-26.pdf\",\"quote\":\"ALPL ectopic expression increased transcytosis of VCAP-102 >100-fold in a transwell model.\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:closest_prior\",\"text\":\"The earlier APPRAISE-AAV study used AlphaFold-Multimer, ten replicate models per matrix, to rank capsid peptides against the receptors LY6A, LY6C1 and CA4, validating one PHP.eB–LY6A pose [s_appraise].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_appraise_rep\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"Matrices ranking AAV peptides by their average competition metric over 10 replicate conditions for LY6A, LY6C1, and mouse CA-IV.\"},{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"}],\"value\":10}
{\"ref\":\"card:left_open\",\"text\":\"Whether a shared 3-fold-axis GPI-engagement motif marks transcytosis-competent pairs across a whole capsid panel, or whether deeper pose sampling changes that call [s_appraise].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"card:anchor\",\"text\":\"Rebuild the published PHP.eB peptide–LY6A complex and require its validated contacts and capsid fit before any library spend [s_appraise].\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_appraise_rmsd\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"RMSD (root mean square deviation) between the computational PHP.eB model and a cryo–electron microscopy (cryo-EM)–based model [Protein Data Bank (PDB) ID: 7WQO] is 0.36 Å. RMSD increases in PHP.eB's engineered loop to 1.36 Å.\"},{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"}],\"value\":0.36}
{\"ref\":\"card:limits\",\"text\":\"Predicted interface geometry only, not transcytosis rates or post-binding fate; weak avidity-dependent contacts may evade prediction [s_appraise]; twelve capsids, six receptors.\",\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\"}]}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_appraise\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"This method uses AlphaFold-Multimer to place surface-exposed peptides spanning mutagenic insertions (AA587 to AA594) from two distinct AAV variants in competition to interact with a potential receptor\",\"supports\":\"Closest prior method: AlphaFold-Multimer peptide–receptor modeling for exactly this receptor question.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_lambda\",\"url\":\"https://lambda.ai/pricing\",\"quote\":\"NVIDIA A100 SXM | VRAM/GPU 40 GB | vCPUs 124 | RAM 1800 GiB | STORAGE 5.8 TiB SSD | PRICE/GPU/HR* $1.99\",\"supports\":\"Rate: $1.99 per A100 40GB GPU-hour on the 8x instance, and 124 vCPUs for the docking overlay.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_alpl\",\"url\":\"https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/POSTER-Voyager_ASGCT_Spring_2024_03_Hoffman_FRIDAY_4-26.pdf\",\"quote\":\"ALPL ectopic expression increased transcytosis of VCAP-102 >100-fold in a transwell model.\",\"supports\":\"Phenotype label: VCAP-102 with ALPL is transcytosis-competent.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_cat\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12682079\",\"quote\":\"Recombinant Car4 was found to bind to the 3-fold protrusions of AAV9-P31. Due to its size, similar to antibodies bound close to the symmetry axis, a localized cryo-EM reconstruction approach was needed to resolve the complex at 1.8 Å resolution.\",\"supports\":\"Experimental precedent: a GPI-anchored BBB receptor binds the 3-fold protrusions of an engineered AAV capsid.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_appraise_rmsd\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"RMSD (root mean square deviation) between the computational PHP.eB model and a cryo–electron microscopy (cryo-EM)–based model [Protein Data Bank (PDB) ID: 7WQO] is 0.36 Å. RMSD increases in PHP.eB's engineered loop to 1.36 Å.\",\"supports\":\"Anchor value and tolerance: published model sits 0.36 Å from PDB 7WQO, 1.36 Å in the engineered loop.\"}
{\"ref\":\"src:s_appraise_rep\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10115422\",\"quote\":\"Matrices ranking AAV peptides by their average competition metric over 10 replicate conditions for LY6A, LY6C1, and mouse CA-IV.\",\"supports\":\"Prior compute level on the pose-model axis: ten replicate models per receptor matrix.\"}
{\"ref\":\"num:af_job_min\",\"name\":\"wall minutes per AlphaFold-Multimer seed job\",\"value\":12,\"unit\":\"minutes\",\"basis\":\"PROXY\",\"quote\":\"Paste a FASTA (monomer or multimer up to 600 aa total) and get pLDDT, PAE, and pTM/ipTM. ~1 to 2 min on A100-40GB.\",\"page_setting\":\"no-MSA single-sequence folding of complexes up to 600 residues on one A100 40GB\",\"differs_in\":[\"ours adds MMseqs2 MSAs, 5 models and up to 20 recycles per job\",\"our complexes are 250 to 400 residues of capsid loop plus receptor ectodomain\"],\"url\":\"https://tools.ranomics.com/help/tools/colabfold\"}
{\"ref\":\"num:md_ns_per_gpu_day\",\"name\":\"MD throughput for the refinement system\",\"value\":240,\"unit\":\"ns per GPU-day\",\"basis\":\"PROXY\",\"quote\":\"A100 | 267.5 | 691.7 | 265.8 | 129.1 | 38.8 | 23.2\",\"page_setting\":\"GROMACS 2024 on one NVIDIA A100, benchmark system 3 (a protein inside a membrane surrounded by explicit water, 80,289 atoms) reaching 265.8 ns/day\",\"differs_in\":[\"our system is about 50,000 atoms of receptor plus capsid loop in water without a membrane\",\"GROMACS version and CPU cores per GPU may differ\"],\"url\":\"https://hpc.fau.de/2024/08/13/gromacs-2024-1-on-brand-new-gpgpus/\"}

